Aquifoliales), Gesneriaceae (including Calceolariaceae and Peltantheraceae, Lamiales), Pentaphylacaceae (including
Sladeniaceae, Ericales), and Orobanchaceae (including Mazaceae, Paulowniaceae, Phrymaceae, and Wightiaceae,
